    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "Navigate screen-by-screen in this Dizzy-esque homebrew puzzle-platformer, enjoying the bouncy chiptune music, collecting tokens for points, avoiding spikes, and defeating enemies who soak up way too many shots before dying. Careful, because the only escape from the Game Over screen is a manual reset!"
    }
